---
const segments = [
  "Alimentícia",
  "Automobilística",
  "Têxtil",
  "Plástica",
  "Borracha",
  "Gráfica",
  "Agrícola",
  "Outro",
];
---

<section id="contato" class="bg-navy-900">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 lg:py-20 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
    <div class="text-white">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight">
        PRONTO PARA ELEVAR A <span class="text-orange-500">PERFORMANCE</span> DOS SEUS EQUIPAMENTOS?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-white/70 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
        Fale com nossos especialistas e solicite seu orçamento sem
        compromisso.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="#contato"
          class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors"
        >
          Solicitar Orçamento
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/554134034034"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/40 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
        >
          Falar no WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 max-w-md">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0 relative bg-[#009c3b]">
          <div class="absolute inset-[18%] bg-[#ffdf00]" style="clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0 50%)"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-[34%] rounded-full bg-[#002776]"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-extrabold text-sm tracking-wide">BRAZILIAN TECHNOLOGY</div>
          <div class="text-white/60 text-xs mt-1 leading-snug">
            Tecnologia brasileira. Qualidade, inovação e confiança em cada
            aplicação.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy-900">
        SOLICITE UM <span class="text-orange-500">ORÇAMENTO</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
        Preencha o formulário e nossa equipe entrará em contato.
      </p>

      <form class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <input
          type="text"
          placeholder="Nome completo*"
          required
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-400"
        />
        <input
          type="text"
          placeholder="Empresa*"
          required
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-400"
        />
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="E-mail*"
          required
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-400"
        />
        <input
          type="tel"
          placeholder="WhatsApp*"
          required
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-400"
        />
        <select
          required
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-400"
        >
          <option value="" selected disabled>Segmento de atuação*</option>
          {segments.map((s) => <option value={s}>{s}</option>)}
        </select>
        <textarea
          placeholder="Descreva sua necessidade*"
          required
          rows="4"
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-400 resize-none"
        ></textarea>

        <label class="col-span-full flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted">
          <input type="checkbox" required class="mt-0.5 accent-orange-500" />
          Concordo com o uso dos meus dados para contato comercial, conforme a
          <a href="/politica-de-privacidade" class="text-orange-500 underline">Política de Privacidade</a>.*
        </label>

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="col-span-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors"
        >
          Solicitar Orçamento
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M4 12h16m0 0l-6-6m6 6l-6 6" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
